==Notes==
*If the final blow on an enemy dealt a corrosive proc the enemy will be dissolved by acid, causing their body to vanish after a couple seconds. This will cause {{A|Magnetize}} to stop pulling in more enemies but abilities like {{A|Desecrate}} may have time to loot the corpse. 

==Tips==
*{{D|Corrosive}} damage can be combined with {{D|Viral}} damage (when applicable) to create a deadly damage combo against enemies with armor, especially the [[Grineer]]. The reduction of armor will lessen the reduction of damage, while viral procs will increase damage dealt even further.

